# Phase 5 T-U2 review round (gpt6-U2): the Ctrl-O reader inside the
# full-detail records when the width changes. p5-transcript-anchor's turn,
# left to finish, so the record is still; Ctrl-O, to the top, Down once: row
# 1 is the `* session:` record's first row on both binaries. Then the window
# narrows to 80 columns and widens back. fx's own reading of a width change
# (`prepare_projection` queues the bookmark its last selection refreshed,
# and a refreshed bookmark skips the records, transcript_presentation.zig:
# 115-122,254-275@481104fd) is the oracle, not "the offset is kept".
# fx's `shell`/`run` is xfx's `terminal`/`exec`; TZ=UTC on both (T-U5).
fx: gateway p5-transcript-anchor-turns.json
xfx: gateway p5-transcript-anchor-xfx.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
env TZ=UTC
work p5-transcript-ws
wait 4
snap start
type read and wait
wait 1
key Enter
wait 14
key C-o
wait 1.5
key PPage PPage PPage PPage
wait 1
key Down
wait 1
snap full-records
resize 40x80
wait 1.5
snap full-records-80
resize 40x120
wait 1.5
snap full-records-120
key C-o
wait 1
gwlog
